      "created_at": "2026-06-22T05:43:22Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-22T05:43:42Z",
      "body": "Pastey crate safety qualification related all the artifact is created and available on `score-crate` repo -  \n\nPlease find the requested documentation and related artifacts below:\n\n| Artifact | Link | Status (\u2705 / \u274c )| Comment |\n|----------|------|--------|---------|\n| Requirements | https://github.com/eclipse-score/score-crates/tree/main/docs/pastey/docs/requirements | \u2705 | Requirement documentation is available at this location. |\n| Design Documents | https://github.com/eclipse-score/score-crates/tree/main/docs/pastey/docs/architecture | \u2705 | This directory contains both the static design and interface design documentation. |\n| Coverage Report | https://github.com/AS1100K/pastey/actions/runs/26143854088/job/76894801208 | \u2705 | Coverage reports are generated through the upstream CI pipeline. If the provided link is no longer accessible, please create a new PR and the latest coverage report will be available in the CI results. |\n| Component Classification Document | https://github.com/eclipse-score/score-crates/blob/main/docs/pastey/docs/component_classification.rst | \u2705  | Component classification document is available here. |\n| Traceability | https://github.com/eclipse-score/score-crates/blob/main/docs/pastey/docs/BUILD | \u2705  | LOBSTER traceability reports can be generated by building the corresponding target described in this file. |\n| Safety Analysis | https://github.com/eclipse-score/score-crates/tree/main/docs/pastey/docs/safety_analysis | \u2705 | This directory contains safety-related documentation, including Assumptions of Use (AoU), Root Cause Analysis, and other relevant safety artifacts. |\n",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
